<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bn">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Song Lyrics</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #121212;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            background: #1e1e1e;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        h2 {
            color: #1db954;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #333;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        p {
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
        .verse {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Song Lyrics</h1>
        
        <div class="verse">
            <h2>[Verse 1]</h2>
            <p>Ratteya ratteya jaga main tere naal[cite: 2]</p>
            <p>Kitne raat kitne raat tere saath tere saath[cite: 2]</p>
            <p>Ratteya ratteya jaga main tere naal[cite: 2]</p>
            <p>Tu bhi aa tu bhi aa mere saath mere saath[cite: 2]</p>
            <p>Katu ratteya re, jagu ratteya re[cite: 2]</p>
            <p>Tere naal rehna si, nal si, nal si[cite: 2]</p>
            <p>Jag ghum aave, main hu yeha pe[cite: 2]</p>
            <p>Na jana tere bina kahi bhi kahi[cite: 2]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="verse">
            <h2>[Chorus]</h2>
            <p>Tu door na ja mujhe chhod ke[cite: 1, 2]</p>
            <p>Tu door na ja[cite: 1, 2]</p>
            <p>Tu door na ja mujhe chhod ke[cite: 1, 2]</p>
            <p>Tu door na ja[cite: 1, 2]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="verse">
            <h2>[Verse 2]</h2>
            <p>Tu bhi aa tu bhi aa mere saath mere saath[cite: 1]</p>
            <p>Likhoon main kahaniyaan sari raat[cite: 1]</p>
            <p>Tere saath tere paas rehna hain din raat[cite: 1]</p>
            <p>Tu hi jaan tu jahaan[cite: 1]</p>
            <p>Yaad teri aave itni sataave[cite: 1]</p>
            <p>Bhool na paaye tuje yaara ye kabhi[cite: 1]</p>
            <p>Yaad teri aave itni rulaave[cite: 1]</p>
            <p>Bhool na paaye tuje yaara ye kabhi[cite: 1]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="verse">
            <h2>[Chorus]</h2>
            <p>Tu door na ja mujhe chhod ke[cite: 1, 2]</p>
            <p>Tu door na ja[cite: 1, 2]</p>
            <p>Tu door na ja mujhe chhod ke[cite: 1, 2]</p>
            <p>Tu door na ja[cite: 1, 2]</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
